{"id":"vod_sn_37139","vodId":"37139","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"可塑性记忆","name_cn":"可塑性记忆","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8444aa3bd044cbafb7bec13daef1454d.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在科技飞速发展的未来世界，彼时，人工智能机器人早已经不是罕见之物，正慢慢地融入人类的生活之中。高考落榜之后，十八岁的青年水柿司（内匠靖明 配音）在父母的帮助下来到了SAI社工作，SAI社的主要产品即是名为“Giftia”的人形智能机器人。　　水柿司被安排到了终端部门工作，来到办公室后水柿司才发现，这个部门的主要职责竟然是回收即将报废的机器人。在这里，水柿司结识了名为艾拉（雨宫天 配音）的少女，她其实正是一名机器人，艾拉外表冷漠不善言其，却有着意外可爱的一面。就这样，水柿司和艾拉成为了工作中的搭档，两人之间渐渐产生了真挚的友谊。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aWkShvHDbU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hdU4x42fJ81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6RwVADmU3r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FQBnRdiHNY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vwj96gYeCX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8KQ4yhbvKQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Rcmw9V3J4X1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bcCLj6VRVa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k5VXYxF7NL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PaMsLKnfJ71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JKyu2AKZLG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HK39PiFYxV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ax43MER5ph1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:14.470Z"}